'''Baby Fake (Merciless)''' is an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] unlocked after clearing [[A Deeper Dream]]. It was added in [[Version 9.6 Update|Version 9.6]] and appears on the '''9th''', '''10th''', '''23rd''', and '''24th''' of every month. When clearing this stage, the player has a chance to unlock [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Bakery Cat]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

